Usage examples of the AUTOSAR MCU Driver can be found at [http://svn.tuxfamily.org/viewvc.cgi/erika_erikae/repos/ee/trunk/ee/examples/cortex_mx/lm4f232xxxx/as  examples/cortex_mx/lm4f232xxxx/as]

