To use the SCI driver in interrupt mode, an ISR object must be added to OSEK/VDX configuration for every SCI Channel:

  ISR Sci_Channel_<Channel Number>_ISR {
    CATEGORY = 2;
    ENTRY = "UART_<Channel Number>";
    PRIORITY = <ISR Priority>;
